{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_01",
      "hash": "3d47d4f9e0a468a1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「噢！[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_02",
      "hash": "3d47d1f9e0a46388",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]也從助手那裡\\n學會了「炫光閃」嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_03",
      "hash": "3d47d2f9e0a4653b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……什麼？不是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳學，\\n而是讓[VAR PKNICK(0003)]學會了！？\\c\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)][VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的搭檔\\n還是這麼厲害啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_10",
      "hash": "3d4b59f9e0a78077",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊！我知道一個地方\\n應該可以讓炫光閃派上用場！\\r\\n要不要我帶[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳到那附近去？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0475_select_01",
      "hash": "7d683be3eb91c217",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我們一起去吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0475_select_02",
      "hash": "7d683ce3eb91c3ca",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我自己去就好"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_04",
      "hash": "3d47d7f9e0a46dba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "噢！那我馬上帶[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳去！\\c\\n我們走吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_05",
      "hash": "3d47d8f9e0a46f6d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "從華藍市這裡\\n往東走……"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_06",
      "hash": "3d47d5f9e0a46a54",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "就是這邊！\\c\\n從這裡一直往前走，\\n好像有一個叫做[VAR COLOR(0006)]岩山隧道[VAR COLOR(0000)]的地方。\\r\\n聽說那裡頭一片漆黑喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_07",
      "hash": "3d47d6f9e0a46c07",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只要用「炫光閃」照亮四周，\\n就不用怕黑了！\\c\\n那就先這樣啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_08",
      "hash": "3d47cbf9e0a45956",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "咦～！這樣啊。\\c\\n……[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一個人真的沒關係嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0475_select_03",
      "hash": "7d683de3eb91c57d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我想一個人去"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0475_select_04",
      "hash": "7d6836e3eb91b998",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "還是一起去吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_09",
      "hash": "3d47ccf9e0a45b09",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好吧！但我還是說一下好了。\\c\\n從[VAR COLOR(0006)]華藍市[VAR COLOR(0000)]一直往東走，\\c\\n有個叫做[VAR COLOR(0006)]岩山隧道[VAR COLOR(0000)]的地方。\\n聽說那裡頭一片漆黑喔！\\c\\n那[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳自己小心了！\\n再見啦！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0475_max",
      "hash": "847641bc3d63e8ef"
    }
  ]
}
